QBU88|SOULCONTRACT", "delay": 0, "is_hurt": 0}, "380112": {"id": 380112, "motion_name": "motions/shake.mtn", "touch_area": "0", "probability": 1.0, "voice": "", "delay": 0, "is_hurt": 0}, "380113": {"id": 380113, "motion_name": "motions/login.mtn", "touch_area": "0", "probability": 1.0, "voice": "GUN|QBU88|HELLO", "delay": 0, "is_hurt": 0}}, "voiceData": {"380101": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "380102": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "380103": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "380104": {"char_code": "QBU88", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE3", "caption": "Did anyone drop their combat reports at the training ground? …If nobody's claiming them, then I'm taking them."}, "380105": {"char_code": "QBU88", "voice_key": "BLACKACTION", "caption": "I'm leading the team this time so there's no need to worry, Commander!"}, "380106": {"char_code": "QBU88", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE2", "caption": "I get so anxious looking at the T-Dolls that do their work so carelessly… I might as well take over the work myself!"}, "380107": {"char_code": "QBU88", "voice_key": "SKILL2", "caption": "Gotcha!"}, "380108": {"char_code": "QBU88", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE1", "caption": "Ah, that new seat cover? I embroidered it myself. Beautiful, isn't it? Let me know if you want me to make you anything, Commander!"}, "380109": {"char_code": "QBU88", "voice_key": "ALLHALLOWS", "caption": "What's the deal about this festival anyway? There are no discounts... Huh? There's free candy? C-count me in!"}, "380110": {"char_code": "QBU88", "voice_key": "DIALOGUEWEDDING", "caption": "Commander, Commander? You'll catch a cold if you sleep at your desk. Ah…it's a mess here. Go to your room. I'll clean up here for you."}, "380111": {"char_code": "QBU88", "voice_key": "SOULCONTRACT", "caption": "Commander, are you really sure about choosing me? You're taking advantage of me, aren't you...<>I am in fact a good homemaker…and I'm not bragging. You got a good deal out of choosing me, Commander.<>I-In any case, I'll be with you from now on, so don't regret it!"}, "380112": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "380113": {"char_code": "QBU88", "voice_key": "HELLO", "caption": "Hello, Commander! I've tidied up your office."}}}